# Analysis Data

## Purpose

This directory stores analytical datasets and research findings developed for the Hindupur Political Intelligence Dashboard.

## Analysis Areas

- Assembly Constituency-wise development analysis
- Political performance analysis
- Public issue analysis
- Government scheme implementation analysis
- Comparative constituency analysis

## Analysis Standards

- Use verified and documented data sources.
- Maintain constituency-wise records.
- Document analytical methods.
- Distinguish facts from interpretations.
- Update datasets when new verified information becomes available.

